# What a build makes: Visual Studio's files, and the built mod. Take the dlls/ line out to ship the built
# DLL (and its build.json) with the source, for players who won't build it.
build/
.vs/
dlls/
*.vcxproj.user

# Written on each computer by tools/sync_ue4ss_props.py from wcmods' UE4SS build: it names that computer's UE4SS
# version and compiler, so it isn't shared. Run the script before the first build (README.md, step 3).
UE4SS.props

# Your own wcmods folder, when wcmods.props' guesses don't fit (see wcmods.props)
wcmods.local.props
